<title>ISRAEL: Pro-Israeli militiaman killed in Lebanon blast.</title>
<headline>Pro-Israeli militiaman killed in Lebanon blast.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb blast killed a pro-Israeli South Lebanon Army (SLA) militiaman in Israel's Lebanon occupation zone on Sunday, Israeli security sources said.</p>
<p>They said the blast occurred in the eastern sector of the 15 km (nine mile) -wide zone apparently while an SLA force was on patrol. There were no further details.</p>
</text>
